  "body": "**Suggestion**\r\n\r\nI would like to specify reply format in one place (account data/state?) and have all clients use it.\r\n\r\nCurrently when I start typing a name and press tabulator, I get `name: ` with name being a pill. I would like to instead get a \"name, \" as I view that as more human thing to do (and as many disagree and believe \":\" to be better or wish to have something entirely different from \",\", I think this should be an option)\r\n\r\nSee also: https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-appservice-irc/issues/1441 which inspired me to open this.",
